e --check`, and a headless screenshot/eval proof were all unreachable. Verified instead by a full manual read of `Voice.js` against the already-working `Recorder.js`/`MicStream.js` it copies the exact shape of. **The first thing anyone with working `node` access should do with this task: `node --check public/framework/audio/Voice/Voice.js public/framework/audio/page.js`, then load `/framework/audio/Voice/` and `/framework/audio/` and press Speak.**\n\nDecision, research and the tool-block are all logged above in this file. Docs updated: `audio/readme.md`, `Voice/readme.md`, `audio/doc/decisions.md`.","links":[{"url":"/framework/audio/Voice/","label":"Voice — its own page"},{"url":"/framework/audio/","label":"audio/ — the combined demo, now with step 4"},{"url":"/framework/audio/doc/decisions.md","label":"doc/decisions.md — d-voice-engine"}],"tokens":null}}
